            "pk": "18001155415802846",
            "text": "🚀 Astana Hub and Draper University are excited to invite technology startups from across Central Eurasia to apply for the second batch of our exclusive acceleration program: Hero Training!\n\nThe program consists of two stages. In the first stage, we will select 80 projects for a two-week online pre-acceleration program. After that, the 15 most promising startups will advance to the offline training, which will take place in Silicon Valley, California.\n\n🔥 Don’t miss out on this incredible opportunity to accelerate your journey in the global market. Be sure to submit your application before the deadline on August 6th. Apply now and let Astana Hub and Draper University empower the success of your startup.\n\n❗️Learn more and submit your application via the link in bio!"
